The '''Yokaa''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[Snake|serpentlike]] [[species]]. They possessed tri-lensed [[eye]]s with multi-spectral vision. [[Kalo'ne]] was a Yokaa who drove a [[DN-25 treadable]] on the [[planet]] [[Pasaana]], her species' vision allowing her skills to remain sharp.<ref name="Encyclopedia" />

